# Denizen MCP bridge

If this workspace is Denizen and you have the Denizen MCP server connected (Abby or team token):

1. Call **`list_cursor_work`** — process `urgent` / `high` pending tasks first.
2. **`claim_cursor_work`** before editing.
3. Fix in-repo; run relevant tests under `denizen/tests/`.
4. **`complete_cursor_work`** with summary and `files_changed`.
5. Use **`get_inference_nodes`** when LM / mesh health is in question.
6. Use **`run_skill`** `coding-agent` for isolated worktree proposals; use direct edits for hotfixes.
7. Use **`assign_task`** / **`delegate_task`** to wake in-world NPCs after shipping.

Denizen CRM, coding, and team ops live on the Denizen MCP URL — not Robinhood (trading-only add-on).

See `denizen/docs/DENIZEN_CURSOR_BRIDGE.md`.
